   KickOS 0.5.1  -  microkernel RTOS
   board   pizero2350
   commit  65fa3473
[wallclock] mark 0, sleeping 5000000000 ns
[wallclock] mark 1, the kernel clock advanced 5000031725 ns, sleeping 5000000000 ns
[wallclock] mark 2, the kernel clock advanced 5000025108 ns
[wallclock] mark 3, a set a day ahead answered 0, the steady clock advanced 1000012345 ns over a sleep of 1000000000 ns, the wall clock 86401000012345 ns
[wallclock] done
